Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eighth Episode\NThe Winged Horse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?\NI recognize that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ship that carries to Earth\Nthe children who are to be born.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it: I'm in Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a naughty little angel I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always causing a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just wanted to have fun!\NLife, up there, is so monotonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the little\Nhearts of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord divides them\Nlike this: boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little one, open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who swallow the\Nhearts blue will be little boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those, on the other hand, who have pink\Nhearts will be little girls. Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole a blue heart\Nfrom the basket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen! Would you like\Nto be a little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what advantage there would be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make a little boy out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What hard work!\NFinally, I'm almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see...\NYou have a cute little face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make you a beautiful little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have already swallowed\Na blue heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say? It must have been\NTink who made this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where did you hide?\N- Forgive me, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You little rascal! Do you know that now,\Nbecause of you, that child...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,won't know if he will have to live as a\Nlittle boy or as a little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Earth\Nand take a heart from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,this is your punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I was only dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I was dreaming\Nactually happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is playing these pranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus! I am glad to see you\Nafter all this time! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you come to\Ndo down here, on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In Heaven,\Ndoes the Lord remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have not yet done\Nwhat God wanted from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord has lost His\Npatience and has tasked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...to take the blue heart of\NSapphire and bring it back to Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, Pegasus! It is\Nnot my fault if I haven't taken it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a series of difficulties!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know well\Neverything that has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,From Heaven I can see\Neverything that happens on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,God's command is absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am forced to take over\Nyour duties, Tink,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will never again\Nbe an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Pegasus! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How inconvenient it is to be a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had the little wings\NI had in Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I could fly instead of walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, maybe I can still\Nfly! I want to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No luck! On Earth\Nit's a completely different thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- There are people!\N- Look, a winged horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- How beautiful he is!\N- Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he lives in Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.02,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Pegasus is going to the castle!\NSapphire is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Something extraordinary!\NA marvel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A horse flying\Ntoward the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! It must be Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's almost above us!\N- Let's go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pegasus, the winged horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a magnificent beast!\N- A unique sight in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he has come to bring\Nhappiness to our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that Pegasus\Nalways brings happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think\Nthat he has come for this reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A legend states\Nthat the countries where Pegasus descends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...become prosperous and happy,\Nso I hope he comes to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know this legend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is flying away!\NI must make him come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!\NI must catch up to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Help me make\NPegasus come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he brings happiness\Nwith him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- He brings happiness?\N- Yes! A legend says..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...that wherever he\Nlands happiness arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus will not bring you\Nwhat you are hoping for, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He has come to Earth to make\Nyou become completely a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What damn good luck to have heard\Nabout the legend of the winged horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost sight of him! I\Nmust try to find him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me: Pegasus will\Nnot bring you happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere! A\Nhorse, even a winged one,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't do what you say! He\Ncan't have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there he is up there! He won't get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I've been waiting for has arrived:\Nfinally Sapphire is left alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NWhat could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I was\Nabout to capture the winged horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A net?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find out who did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange... I was sure\Nthere was someone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baron Nylon! - Hello, Prince!\NWhat are you doing in these parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a winged horse!\NHave you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be joking?!\NA winged horse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Pegasus, the horse that\Nbrings happiness wherever he lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear they've captured him.\NDo you know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Prince! I was passing by here\Nby chance and saw nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If this horse\Nbrings happiness,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you find him\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was easy to deceive\Nthat stupid brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no idea that it was\Nme who captured Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a splendid idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not bad, this magical\Nhouse of the Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,First I scared the brat with\Nthe dynamite that I was given...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then I managed\Nto capture that horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never seen\Nsuch a splendid horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, are you really sure\Nthat it will bring us happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, Baron Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of my nose right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bites on my nose\Ndo not make me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please calm down!\NDon't take it out on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I brought you\Na one-of-a-kind horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a great idea,\Ndear Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Listen to me!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire is...?\N- Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for that horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a great opportunity\Nto eliminate the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Baron Nylon, you\Nare smarter than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the compliment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See? We just need to choose the\None that looks the most like Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this one, not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely not: its muzzle\Nis a bit too rounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of this other colt, however,\Nit's the eyes that I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It will have to be a\Nvery elegant horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But they are all elegant like\Nthis! Which one to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finished! Admire\Nmy masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've done a good\Njob. I admire your skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there is nothing left\Nfor us to do but put this wasp...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...into the ear of the\Nfake Pegasus and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.98,0:13:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've anesthetized it, but\Nas soon as it wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...it will start\Nbuzzing in its ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Sapphire sees the horse\Non the ground, she will think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll be\Nable to find Pegasus..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Sapphire! Listen!\NThat Pegasus is fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That horse's wings are fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen! Sapphire, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the wasp should\Nwake up and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little horse!\NStart flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one... Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?\NWhat's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump like that, please!\NStop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hold on! Don't fall!\NWhat can I do? Hold on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, come on!\NDon't fret, little horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't make it! Opal, help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, he's plummeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank heaven! Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, how are you? Are\Nyou alright? How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this wasp\Nthat made the horse bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone put it in his ear\Non purpose to get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This colt is not Pegasus. Who\Ncould have set up this trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was Nylon who\Nplayed this other dirty trick on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But why does that damn\Nbrat have to be so lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never finish him off,\Ndamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it!\N- Nylon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Prince!\NI'm taking a walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you are well and healthy!\NI'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye.\N- No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And now tell me: why did you\Ndeceive me with that fake Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the real one? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you talking about,\NPrince?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I assure you I know nothing about it!\N- You are a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you who captured him\Nand you are hiding him yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think so, see for yourself\Nwith your own eyes. Search for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, please! I will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Go ahead and look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here... and here! And here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! I'll\Nnever find him this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find out where you are\Nkeeping him hidden, Baron Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will punish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Opal, I still need\Nyour help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure that with your sense of smell you\Nwill succeed in finding where Pegasus is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go find him, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- This time you must not fail.\N- Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had already planned\Nthe second move...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,..and the next trap\Nwill be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who we will\Nuse this time? The real Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you Prince Sapphire?\N- Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who are you?\N- I am a poor old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers and I\Nlive in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw a winged\Nhorse injured in one leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,..at the foot of the mountain..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we wanted to warn\Nyou: maybe that horse is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But Pegasus heals quickly\Nfrom his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll see!\N- He's onto us! Let's finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak! Do you know\Nwhere Nylon put Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes...\N- Then, if you value your life, you will lead me to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really him!\NNow you can leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the Prince!\NGet ready! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring the traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?\NStop! I'm your colleague!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots! That's not the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- But it looked like him!\N- Why are you such idiots?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is Sapphire! Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, we're here!\N- Be careful, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to meet you\Nin person for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I will take\Nyour life, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will cut off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call,\Nthey almost killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sapphire, don't ride\NPegasus! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pegasus! Wait, Sapphire!\NListen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, get down! You don't know what\Nyou're doing! It's starting to rain...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Opal: they are heading\Ntowards that church on the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Pegasus!\NDon't take the blue heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take it away from her,\Nshe will be killed by the evil ones..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...who want to take over\Nher kingdom! Do you understand, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire must remain\Nwith a male heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,until she defeats the enemies\Nwho lurk among her people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is why she prefers\Nto have a boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise the people\Nwill fall into the hands of the wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Sapphire as she is\Nuntil she has rendered them harmless!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist on wanting to take from her\Nthe heart I gave her in Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight you to prevent it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the Lord that I myself will return\NSapphire's blue heart to Him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,when in Silverland\Npeace reigns once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.70,0:22:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so happy!\NYou understood us, didn't you, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.18,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the Lord I'm sorry\Nfor the trouble I've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye, Pegasus!\N- His mission is over
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.74,0:23:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he is returning to Heaven\Nand will report everything to the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, I've realized that happiness\Nis not thanks to a winged horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be earned\Nwith sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will try for my people\Nand for my country!
