Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:58.31,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:01.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.31,0:25:01.61,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.61,0:25:05.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k33}{\k33}A{\k22}ku{\k25}ma {\k17}ga {\k35}ku{\k36}te {\k24}mo {\k19}a{\k18}ra{\k30}shi {\k11}ga {\k36}ku{\k33}te {\k28}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.61,0:25:05.61,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.61,0:25:09.05,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}tsu{\k17}na{\k27}i{\k21}da {\k17}ko{\k21}ko{\k29}ro {\k16}wa {\k22}ha{\k32}na{\k26}re{\k14}na{\k79}i
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.61,0:25:09.05,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Our bonded hearts will never part.
